# Architecture Rules

## Layer Boundaries

Enforced by `npm run lint` (`.eslintrc.js`, level `error`), `npm run lint:cycles` (madge) and `__tests__/storageKeyOwnership.test.ts`.

| Layer | Can Import | Must NOT Import |
|-------|------------|-----------------|
| **Surfaces / components** | `hooks`, `ui`, `theme`, `types`, `navigation`, `services` (analytics etc.), `core/time/clock` (display formatting, ADR-7) | `di`, `persistence`, `infrastructure`, other `core`, repository/use-case *runtime* imports |
| **ui/** (presentational) | `theme`, `types`, own `ui/` hooks (e.g. `useReduceMotion`) | `hooks`, `di`, `persistence`, `infrastructure`, `core` |
| **Hooks** | `di`, `core`, `services`, `infrastructure` (WidgetSync), domain *types* | `persistence`, repository/use-case classes at runtime |
| **Services / stores** | `persistence` for keys they own, `config`, `types` | `di` (take state as parameters or injected sources) |
| **Use Cases** | `domain/repository` + `domain/ports` (interfaces), `core` (pure), `types`, `config` constants | `persistence`, SDKs, React |
| **Repositories / adapters** | `core`, `persistence`, `types`, SDKs | `di`, React UI |
| **Core / domain** | `types`, `config` constants | React, RN, SDKs, storage, any outer layer |

Domain *types* (DTOs, result types) may be imported anywhere with `import type`; only runtime access must go through `di`.

## Storage key ownership

Every `STORAGE_KEYS` entry is used by exactly one module (repository, service or store). Other code reads the value through that owner, either via a use case or an injected source (see `configureWidgetSync`, `configureRetentionNotifications` in `di.ts`). The ownership test fails if two modules touch the same key.

## SSOT (Single Source of Truth)

- **Time/profile data**: `TimeRepository` (via `MmkvTimeRepository`) — only place that reads/writes user/time to MMKV
- **Widget cache**: `TimeRepository.getWidgetCache()` — same time logic as `getTimeState()`
- **Progress colors**: `theme/progressColor.ts` — `getProgressColor(progress)`; UI consumes, no duplicate logic
- **Widget config**: `IWidgetConfigRepository` (AsyncStorage) → `widgetConfigStore` (UI cache, created in `di.ts`); accent for native widgets via `WidgetSync.publishWidgetAccent`
- **Theme**: `theme/palettes.ts` + `stores/themeStore.ts` — design tokens (light/dark); UI consumes via `useTheme()` only; persistence via AsyncStorage
- **Types/DTOs**: `types/index.ts` — `WidgetCache`, `UserProfile`, `TimeProgress`, etc.
- **Storage keys**: `persistence/schema.ts` — shared with native widgets

## Composition Root

- All repository → use case wiring in `di.ts`
- Add new use case: implement in `domain/useCases/`, instantiate in `di.ts`, export

## Data Flow

1. **Read**: Screen → Hook → Use Case → Repository → MMKV / Core
2. **Write**: Screen → Hook → Use Case → Repository.setX() → MMKV → subscribe() notifies
3. **Widget sync**: `syncWidgetCache()` calls `SyncWidgetUseCase.execute()` → `TimeRepository.getWidgetCache()` → MMKV → native bridge
